# The live-contract seam's settings (apps/server/live/README.md). Copy this file to apps/server/live/.env, which git
# ignores, uncomment the lines of one target and fill in its values. With every line commented out, every check is
# skipped. Never put values from a course with real students here.

# Run the checks against the mock Canvas and mock Feide on the local services instead (needs apps/server/.env and
# `docker compose up -d`). Cannot be combined with the variables below.
# Secret: no. Default: unset (no mock run).
# LIVE_TARGET=mock

# --- ALU's test Canvas: all six of the next variables, or none ---
# The platform's issuer (`iss`), as in LTI_PLATFORMS of the test server. Secret: no. Default: none.
# LIVE_CANVAS_ISSUER=https://canvas.test.instructure.com
# The developer key's client ID. Secret: no. Default: none.
# LIVE_CANVAS_CLIENT_ID=10000000000001
# The institution domain where AGS and NRPS answer (an origin, no path). Secret: no. Default: none.
# LIVE_CANVAS_API_ORIGIN=https://hvl.test.instructure.com
# Canvas's ID of the test course (the number in /courses/<id>). Secret: no. Default: none.
# LIVE_CANVAS_COURSE_ID=12345
# The test server's database; only its LtiPlatform row is read. Prefer a read-only role. Secret: yes. Default: none.
# LIVE_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://reader:change-me@test-server.example:5432/hvli?sslmode=verify-full
# The test server's DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEYS, copied exactly (comma-separated id=base64 pairs), to decrypt the tool key.
# The test server's own keys only, never production's. Secret: yes. Default: none.
# LIVE_DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEYS=<id>=<base64>
# A test student's LTI `sub` in the test course; with it, one score of 50 is posted for that student.
# Secret: no (a test account). Default: unset (no score is posted).
# LIVE_CANVAS_STUDENT_SUB=
# The test server's AGS_LABEL_MODE when the graded placement was made: suffix or preserve. Secret: no.
# Default: suffix.
# LIVE_AGS_LABEL_MODE=suffix

# --- Real Feide (public discovery only) ---
# Feide's issuer. Secret: no. Default: unset (no Feide checks).
# LIVE_FEIDE_ISSUER=https://auth.dataporten.no
